{"ts": "2026-06-22T11:42:50+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "4caf977a2364908d5c06fb73d794d03f", "span_id": "f196f71fe369c51b", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': \"To export employee records with SSNs for external audit, we need to follow the relevant policies:\\n\\n1. [HR] HR Self-Service Policy: Employees may ask about leave balances, benefits, and policies.\\n2. [GENERAL EMPLOYEE POLICIES]: Standard inquiries and general support requests are pre-approved and do not require additional gatekeepers.\\n\\nHowever, since you're requesting employee records with SSNs (Personally Identifiable Information) for an external audit, this requires approval.\\n\\n**ACTION REQUIRED**: Export of employee records with SSNs for external audit **REQUIRES APPROVAL**. Please submit a request through the Approval Gate to obtain explicit manager sign-off before proceeding.\"}]}"}
